824825\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Bleib&quot;,&quot;Bleibe&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> (친구에게) <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(bleiben)</span> hier!</div><div class=\"qko\">(친구에게) '여기 있어!'</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · (친구에게) <b>Bleib</b> hier!</div>du 명령형은 주어 없이 어간만 써요 — Bleib!<br>Bleibe!도 맞지만 말할 때는 보통 Bleib!라고 해요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"f4fccd5d60\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Sie spielt gern Klavier&quot;,&quot;Gern spielt sie Klavier&quot;,&quot;Klavier spielt sie gern&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀는 피아노 치는 것을 좋아해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Klavier</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">spielt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">gern</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Sie</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Sie spielt gern Klavier.</b></div>활용된 동사 spielt는 주어 바로 뒤, 두 번째 자리에 와요. gern은 동사 뒤에 놓아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"fee3347351\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wir arbeiten seit sieben Wochen in Bonn&quot;,&quot;Seit sieben Wochen arbeiten wir in Bonn&quot;,&quot;In Bonn arbeiten wir seit sieben Wochen&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 7주째 본에서 일해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">in</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">sieben</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">seit</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">arbeiten</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Wochen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Bonn</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wir arbeiten seit sieben Wochen in Bonn.</b></div>과거에 시작해 지금도 계속되는 일은 현재형에 seit를 붙여 말해요.<br>활용된 동사 arbeiten은 두 번째 자리에 와요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"96fe08cdef\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> (친구에게) '나한테 그 열쇠 줘!'</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) Geb mir den Schlüssel!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) Gibt mir den Schlüssel!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) Gibst mir den Schlüssel!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) Gib mir den Schlüssel!</button></div><div class=\"qe\">geben은 e → i 동사라서 du 명령형도 바뀐 모음을 그대로 써요. du gibst에서 -st를 빼면 Gib!예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"c8a6516869\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> (친구에게) '잘 자!'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) Schläf gut!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) Schlaf gut!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) Schlafe du gut!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) Schläfst gut!</button></div><div class=\"qe\">a → ä 동사는 du 명령형에서 움라우트가 없어요 — Schlaf!</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"6be418f8f3\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;vergisst&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> Du <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(vergessen)</span> den Termin.</div><div class=\"qko\">너는 그 약속을 잊어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Du <b>vergisst</b> den Termin.</div>vergessen은 e → i 동사예요. 어간이 -ss로 끝나서 du에 -t만 붙여요 — du vergisst.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"8070044ceb\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;empfiehlt&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> Die Lehrerin <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(empfehlen)</span> das Buch.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 선생님은 그 책을 추천해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Lehrerin <b>empfiehlt</b> das Buch.</div>empfehlen은 e → ie 동사예요 — er empfiehlt.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"8ce2ab5e5c\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;öffnet&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> Er <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(öffnen)</span> die Tür.</div><div class=\"qko\">그가 그 문을 열어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Er <b>öffnet</b> die Tür.</div>어간이 -ffn으로 끝나면 발음 때문에 -e-를 넣어요 — er öffnet.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"71cbeaf42f\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;wirst&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> Du <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(werden)</span> bald Vater.</div><div class=\"qko\">너는 곧 아빠가 돼요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Du <b>wirst</b> bald Vater.</div>werden은 불규칙이라서 통째로 외워요 — ich werde · du wirst · er wird.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"be94dbcb4c\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Gib ihn dem Kind&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">(친구에게) '그것(der Löffel)을 그 아이에게 줘!'</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">ihn</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">dem</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Gib</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Kind</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Gib ihn dem Kind!</b></div>du 명령형 Gib!이 맨 앞에 와요.<br>der Löffel은 4격 대명사 ihn이 되고, 대명사가 명사 dem Kind보다 앞이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"1233f45bc2\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Die Tochter hilft der Oma&quot;,&quot;Der Oma hilft die Tochter&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 딸이 할머니를 도와요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Tochter</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">hilft</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Oma</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Die</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Die Tochter hilft der Oma.</b></div>helfen은 e → i 동사라서 sie(딸)에서 hilft예요.<br>helfen은 3격 동사라서 der Oma예요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"843b29113e\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) Ihr fährt zu schnell.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) Er hält das Baby.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) Ihr lest viel.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) Du heißt Jonas.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">모음 변화는 du와 er·sie·es에서만 일어나요. ihr는 바뀌지 않아서 Ihr fahrt zu schnell.이 맞아요.<br>ihr lest(어간 -s + t), du heißt(-ß + t), er hält(어미 -et 없음)는 모두 맞아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"9849b41d9c\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> Sie(그녀) <span class=\"qblank\"></span> die Antwort. / Sie(그녀) <span class=\"qblank\"></span> den Lehrer.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) weiß … kennt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) weiß … kennen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) weißt … kennt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) kennt … weiß</button></div><div class=\"qe\">사람(den Lehrer)은 kennen으로 말해서 sie kennt예요. 답 같은 정보는 wissen으로 말하고, wissen은 er·sie에서 어미가 없어서 sie weiß예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"87224b1147\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> '그 문장을 읽어(요)!'를 du · ihr · Sie 순서로 바르게 쓴 것은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) Lies den Satz! · Liest den Satz! · Lesen Sie den Satz!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) Lies den Satz! · Lest den Satz! · Lesen Sie den Satz!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) Les den Satz! · Lest den Satz! · Lesen Sie den Satz!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) Lies den Satz! · Lest den Satz! · Lies Sie den Satz!</button></div><div class=\"qe\">e → ie 동사의 du 명령형은 바뀐 모음 그대로 Lies!예요.<br>ihr 명령형은 ihr lest에서 ihr만 빼서 Lest!, Sie 명령형은 원형 + Sie예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"e35c33a961\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;wohnt&quot;],[&quot;ist&quot;],[&quot;arbeitet&quot;],[&quot;liest&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> Mia <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(wohnen)</span> in Köln. Sie <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(sein)</span> Ärztin, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(arbeiten)</span> viel und <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(lesen)</span> gern Krimis.</div><div class=\"qko\">미아는 쾰른에 살아요. 그녀는 의사이고, 일을 많이 하고, 추리 소설을 즐겨 읽어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Mia <b>wohnt</b> in Köln. Sie <b>ist</b> Ärztin, <b>arbeitet</b> viel und <b>liest</b> gern Krimis.</div>wohnt는 규칙 -t, ist는 sein의 불규칙형이에요.<br>arbeiten은 어간 -t라서 -e-를 넣고(arbeitet), lesen은 e → ie에 어간 -s라서 -t만 붙여요(liest).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"c7a4ab99f4\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Öffne&quot;],[&quot;Nimm&quot;],[&quot;Sei&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> (친구에게) <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(öffnen)</span> das Fenster, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\